window.products.push({"id":96023,"name":"(2023 Upgraded) DC97-16350C Washer Suspension Rod Kit(4 Pack) by Beaquicy - Replacement for Samsung Washers - Replaces DC97-16350E, DC97-05280W, DC97-","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":27.47,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/517pAr7pM6L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"ABS plastic material and metal ✅【IDEAL REPLACEMENT PART】:4 Pack DC97-16350C samsung washer suspension rods act as shock absorbers to minimize the vibration of the bathtub in rotating mode, reducing vibration and noise and no longer worrying about annoying laundry noise. These suspended support rods absorb shock and reduce the rotating mode during bathtub vibration for quieter operation. They are approximately 25.6 inches in length. The package includes 4 x dc97-16350c washer suspension rod kit updated. ✅【MADE OF HIGH QUALITY MATERIAL】:These 4pack dc97-16350c washer suspension rod kit is made of ABS plastic material and metal, the material is durable and ensures high efficiency. Non OEM but quality equal to OEM requirements, and well-tested by manufacturer, to maintain a longer service life. The right price won't put too much burden on you. If your washer was making noise, washer wouldn't stay balanced when spin cycle, washer displays the DC error code, you made to replace the washer suspension rods. ✅【REPLACEMENT PART No.】:4 Pack DC97-16350C washer suspension support rods and spring(Pack of 4) replaces original Sam-sung suspension rod and spring assembly.➤Fits models Samsung top-load washer models: 3282689, AP5623264, PS4221572, EAP4221572, PD00007282, DC97-16350C, WA400PJHDWR/AA-01, WA400PJHDWR/AA-02, WA400PJHDWR/AA-03, WA422PRHDWR/AA-02, WA422PRHDWR/AA-00, WA422PRHDWR/AA-01, WA422PRHDWR/AA-03. ✅【2 Years WARRANTY】:The dc97-16350c 4 pack samsung washer suspension rod replacement supports 731 days return and exchange.Our company attaches great importance to the shopping experience of each customer.Risk-free shopping, If you have any quality problem during warranty period, please contact customer service in time. We will try our best to solve the problem. Customer satisfaction is our tireless pursuit. ✅【SAVE MONEY SAVE TIME】 - The installation of Suspension rods and spring assembly DC97-16350C is very simple, pay attention to disconnect the power of the washing machine before installation. Prepare a Phillips screwdriver, adhesive tape, and gloves. You do not need a professional to repair, you can follow the steps of the YouTube video to install, about 25-30 minutes to complete the installation.DIY installation can save a lot of money on replacing a washer or hiring a mechanic.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/517pAr7pM6L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Beaquicy","source_asin":"B082XLY1VB","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-96023","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B082XLY1VB","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B082XLY1VB","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
