window.products.push({"id":96046,"name":"Freezer Door Alarm, Briidea Refrigerator Door Alarm When Left Open, with 60/120/180 Seconds Delay Alert, Remind You Close Your Fridge Door, Avoid Food","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":16.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51Mok9GsLqL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"NO MORE WASTE FOOD: With our refrigerator door delay alarm, when your refrigerator door left open or ajar, it will issue a sound from low to high until the door is closed. Never worry about wasting foods and electricity anymore EFFECTIVE EXTEND FRIDGE SERVICE LIFE: We all know that the long-term opening of the refrigerator door will prolong the working time of the compressor and shorten the service life of the refrigerator. Now just with a small investment, you can effectively extend the life of your expensive refrigerator, why not? DELAY ALARM FEATURE: It will beep every 10 seconds for the first minute, then a Di Di alert for 2 seconds after 1 minute, reminder alarm for 4 seconds after 2 minutes if the fridge door is still open or ajar. You have 59 seconds to take food out of the refrigerator or freezer CONSTANT ALARM: Continuous alert after 3 minuters, volume up to 110dB loud enough to be heard no matter where you are, and will definitely help you close the fridge or freezer door. It can also a great way to know if your child is stealing snacks at night EASE TO USE: Contains 3 * LR44 batteries for extremely low power consumption for up to a year use. No tools needed, simple peel and stick installation on any freezer or fridge. It's small and it doesn't affect the beauty of your refrigerator at all. (Note: When installing, the distance between the alarm and the sensor should be less than 0.8 inches)","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51Mok9GsLqL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"briidea","source_asin":"B0BDDFJR17","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-96046","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BDDFJR17","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BDDFJR17","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":96047,"name":"Temperature Hygrometer,Indoor Digital Hygrometer Thermometer, Thermometer Humidity Gauge Meter, Touchscreen and Backlight Temperature Humidity Monitor","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61hVCUsirjL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Feature 1.Weight:130g 2.Appearance Size:119*88*26mm 3.Error Range:±1℃,±5%RH 4.Accuracy Range:0.1℃,1%RH 5.Battery:1.5V（AAA）×2 6.Humidity Measuring Range:10%-98% 7.Temperature Measuring Range:-10℃-70℃（14℉-158℉） Instruction MODE BUTTON Press MODE button once to switch between time displaying and alarm setting.(Attention:If the two dots stop flashing and“AL”signal keep displaying on the screen, it means alarm setting is present.)  During the time displaying mode，you can press MODE button and hold for 2 seconds to enter time setting mode,in this mode you can set up minute,hour,12/24 hour mode,year,month and day.During the numbers flashing on the screen,you can press ADJ button to adjust.After finishing a setting,you can press MODE button again to enter next setting.If you don’t execute any button operation in one minute,the setting user interface will dismiss automatically.  During the alarm setting mode (AL signal),you can press MODE button and hold for 2 seconds to enter alarm time setting,which is similar with time setting. ADJ BUTTON When you are setting time,date or alarm time,you can press ADJ button continuously and the digital numbers will increase rapidly.  During the alarm time displaying mode,you can press ADJ button once to set the alarm on/off.(If the alarm is on,a bell icon will appear over the time numbers.)  During the alarm time displaying mode,you can press ADJ button twice to set the nowtime on/off.(If the nowtime is on,a signal icon will appear over the time numbers.)  During the alarm time displaying mode,you can press ADJ button three times to set the alarm and nowtime on/off at the same time.(If the alarm and nowtime are on,their corresponding icons will appear on the screen.) LIGHT BUTTON If you press LIGHT button,the backlight of screen will flash for 5 seconds.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61hVCUsirjL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Telead","source_asin":"B07CMR79RQ","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-96047","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07CMR79RQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B07CMR79RQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
