window.products.push({"id":96259,"name":"CROWNFUL Ice Maker Countertop, Portable Ice Machine, 9 Bullet Ice Cubes Ready in 7-10 Mins, 33 lbs Ice Cubes in 24H, 2 Size (S/L) Crunchy Ice, Automat","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":135.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/618jIwvVi7L._SL1500_.jpg","description":"🧊【Small & Large Ice Cubes Selectable】There are two ice cube sizes to choose from. One is the large size bullet-shaped ice cubes that are difficult to melt and sticks together. The ice cubes preserve the taste of the fresh drink, allowing you to stay refreshed. Another one is small round and smooth bullet-shaped ice cubes, which will not hurt your hands and is ideal for cooling drinks in small openings bottles. 🥤【Efficient & Fast】The CROWNFUL stainless steel nugget ice machine has a powerful compressor but it operates with little noise. It has 120W low power sonic ice maker that consumes lower electricity. Definitely cost and energy efficient. In just 7 mins, you'll get 9 pcs chewable, bullet-shaped ice-cubes. The machine has 2.8L water tank capacity and can produce up to 33lbs of ice daily. The bin can hold 3.3lbs when full. If a glass of drink needs 5-10 ice cubes, it can fill 185-370 cups. 🍹【Multiple Functions with Self-Cleaning】The ice maker has the most advanced infrared sensing technology. The indicator light will remind you to take out the ice cubes when the basket is full. You can view the ice-making process through the transparent window. It will automatically notify you to add water when the ice machine is short of water. It also has an advanced one-touch self-cleaning function and no leakage which makes cleaning up effortless and helps to produce cleaner ice. 🥃【Compact Ice Maker & Wide Applications】This CROWNFUL stainless steel portable ice machine is more durable than other small plastic ice machines. It has 3-layer foaming technology (stainless steel metal plate, thickened foaming layer, and food-grade PP) that ensures longer ice storage time. It is ideal for use at home, bar, tea shop, kitchen, and at the office. 🥂【Warranty & Support】 CROWNFUL offers a 12-month warranty and lifetime support. Customer Satisfaction is our TOP priority. If you have any problems, please feel free to contact us. Note: You'd better put the ice maker upright for at least 2-4 hours before using it.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/618jIwvVi7L._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"CROWNFUL","source_asin":"B0BPY9HMGY","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-96259","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BPY9HMGY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BPY9HMGY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
