window.products.push({"id":96270,"name":"Flexible PVC Laminated Aluminum Dryer Duct - 20 Feet","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":20.97,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/7170gk6MIZL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Did you know a bad dryer duct could cause a fire in your laundry room? A build up of lint, flattened tubes, and wobbly hoses all contribute to a dangerous, yet preventable accident. Introducing the Kelaro Reinforced Dryer Transition Duct, a flexible, sturdy solution to your drying vent needs. This duct takes all the features of our standard dryer duct and wraps it in a black PVC laminate that significantly increases the durability in more challenging environments. Our drying duct is made of high quality aluminum and features an easy to install, universally compatible design. Fitted with two premium screw clamps, this fire resistant dryer duct forms a tight seal to direct fumes and humidity safely away from living spaces. The multi-ply PVC coated dryer transition duct is constructed of aluminum foil laminate that encapsulates a high density, corrosion resistant wire helix. Superior to other ducts on the market, our product provides you with a vent hose connection that won't fail. Purchase yours today for an easy and reliable solution that will keep your laundry room risk-free. Product Highlights 4\" x 10' FLEXIBLE PVC Reinforced Aluminum Transition Duct Compatible with front-load and top-load dryers. Outer layer of BLACK PVC Plastic Protects and Strengthens Aluminum Interior Layer. EASY TO INSTALL for contractors or homeowners. Suitable for gas dryer or electric dryer applications UNIVERSALLY COMPATIBLE with Dryers from Whirlpool, Samsung, LG, GE, Kenmore, Bosch, Maytag, Amana, Electrolux, Speed Queen and more. FIRE RESISTANT DRYER DUCT - Forms a tight seal to direct fumes and humidity safely away from living spaces. PVC MULTI-PLY Exterior Protects Aluminum foil laminate interior that encapsulates a high density, corrosion resistant wire helix - constructed to replace inferior vinyl ducts. KIT INCLUDES: Two premium 4 inch worm hose clamps for a secure connection to wall and rear of dryer. Upgraded clamps ensure a superior dryer vent hose connection that won't fail like others","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/7170gk6MIZL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Kelaro","source_asin":"B01MTXO405","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-96270","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01MTXO405","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B01MTXO405","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
