window.products.push({"id":96320,"name":"Jura CLEARYL Smart Mini Water Filter Cartridge for ENA 8 Coffee Machine (3-Pack) Bundle (3 Items)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61KP6adHSLL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Coffee is 98% water. So water of the highest quality is essential to creating the best possible coffee experience. The CLEARYL Smart mini from Jura revolutionizes water filtration. For the first time, thanks to modern RFID (Radio-frequency Identification) technology, a coffee machine can continually communicate with the filter. It recognizes whether a filter has been inserted and automatically activates the appropriate mode. It continually collects information about filter use and alerts the user when the filter capacity has been exhausted. This not only makes changing the filter easier than ever before but also allows the CLEARYL Smart mini to achieve optimum effectiveness. This filter cartridge is designed for ENA 8 Coffee Machine models (15281, 15284, and 15282). Suitable for All Types of Mains Water CLEARYL Smart mini works according to the professional up-flow principle and always filters exactly the amount of water required for each preparation. Thanks to the pioneering formula, the filter cartridges are ideally suited to mains water anywhere in the world. The modified granule always filters limescale to an optimum level (even when the water hardness is low) and reduces the level of all harmful substances more efficiently than ever before. Minerals and fluorides that are important for helping flavors to develop are fully retained in the water. The optimum stabilization of limescale and efficient filtering of harmful substances always results in optimum water quality for a perfect coffee flavor. Automatic Filter Detection To enable the filter and coffee machine to communicate, Jura uses modern RFID technology. Bundle Includes: 3 x Jura CLEARYL Smart Mini Water Filter Cartridge for ENA 8 Coffee Machine 3 x Jura CLEARYL Smart Mini Water Filter Cartridge for ENA 8 Coffee Machine","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61KP6adHSLL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Jura","source_asin":"B09KVCMKKW","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-96320","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09KVCMKKW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B09KVCMKKW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":96321,"name":"4681EA2001T Washer Drain Pump Motor by Techecook - Replacement for Kenmore LG Washing Machine Drain Pump ap5328388 4681ea1007g 2003273 4681ea1007d 468","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":18.97,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/7172itI+jhL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Durable High Quality Material ✅【ITEM SPECIALITY & DURABLE】--- 4681EA2001T AP5328388 Washer Drain Pump is a part for your washer. 4681EA2001T Drain pump helps expel water from the washing machine and is activated after the spin cycle speed is maintained for a specific period of time. Complete pump and motor assembly along with removable filter housing for easier cleaning. When your drain pump motor fails, you can end up with sopping wet clothes that take longer to dry ✅【PACKAGE INCLUDES】--- The package you will receive contain 1 x 4681EA2001T lg drain pump. SPECIFICATIONS:120V-127V 60Hz 85W 1.4A 45L/Min. Replacing AP5328388 lg washer pump motor can effectively solve the following common symptoms: ① Washer will not drain ②washer pumps won’t spin ③noisy cycles ④ washer leaks. The 4681EA2001T Washing Machine Drain Pump Motor allows your washer to drain properly after the spin cycle finishes, and quiet when running ✅【COMPATIBLE MODEL】--- 4681EA2001T Washer Drain Pump compatible with Ken-more and L-G washing machine. Brand new, Perfect fit. Replaces part numbers: 4681EA1007D, 4681EA1007G, 4681EA2001D, 4681EA2001N, 4681EA2001U, 2003273, AP5328388, PS3579318, EAP3579318, etc. If you are not sure that your washer can fit the 4681EA2001T AP5328388 washer drain pump motor, please contact us. Amazon official logistics, your products will have a strong logistics guarantee ✅【365-DAYS WARRANTY】--- During the warranty period, if the 4681EA2001T lg washing machine drain pump has quality problem or other reasons, we support return, replacement or refund. Customer satisfaction is our unremitting pursuit. If you are not satisfied with the product, please contact us immediately. We will try our best to solve the problem. Lg washer drain pump 4681EA2001T AP5328388 is made from durable high quality material and well-tested by the manufacturer - Meets OEM standards ✅【DIY INSTALLATION】--- Before installing 4681EA2001T Drain Pump, you need prepare a phillips screwdriver, flat-blade screwdriver, needle nose pliers, slip-joint pliers and disconnect the power and water supply. Remove the drain cover on the cleaner, disconnect the wiring harness and two hoses on the drain pump assembly. Two washers on the tilted back leg. Loosen the two screws and disassemble the drain pump. Install a new one and tighten the screws.Connect hoses, wiring harnesses and gaskets","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/7172itI+jhL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Techecook","source_asin":"B08T8TVR93","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-96321","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08T8TVR93","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B08T8TVR93","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
