window.products.push({"id":96590,"name":"Broan E66130WH Elite Ultra Quiet Range Hood, 30-Inch, White","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/21P6kFHIrxL._AC_.jpg","description":"Product Description The clean, seamless design of this thinner than average range hood fits snugly under cabinets and provides quiet and effective ventilation performance. Subtle, multi-speed controls connect to centrifugal blowers while halogen lighting brilliantly accents the easy to clean stainless steel bottom containing dishwasher safe filters. The E661 high performance range hood beautifully combines high style and modern convenience to satisfy even the most discerning homeowner. Boost mode operates at up to 600 CFM; Normal setting operates at a quiet 0.4 Sones. Large recessed filter area increases capture and fully enclosed filter bottom ensures fast and easy clean-up. 3-speed control with boost memorizes last setting and 5-minute delay shut off feature make operation simple and convenient. Dual 50-watt halogen lights have last setting memory and transitional theater lighting which intensifies gradually (light bulbs included). Heat Sentry detects excess heat and adjusts blower to high automatically to prolong product life. Dishwasher safe aluminum filters. From the Manufacturer Broan Elite E661 Series delivers Ultra Quiet Performance. The clean, smooth design of this range hood fits snugly under cabinets and provides quiet and effective ventilation. Be sure your blower matches the BTU output of your range. Since 1932, Broan-NuTone LLC has led the industry with forward-thinking residential ventilation products, unsurpassed built-in convenience products and superior customer service. While global expertise plays a critical role in Broan-NuTone's ability to being able to meet and exceed the needs and desires of homeowners and designers alike, Broan-NuTone is very proud of the fact that over 80-percent of their products sold in the United States are designed, engineered and manufactured in the United States with U.S. and imported parts. Broan-NuTone is committed to developing revolutionary products that improve the indoor environment as well as implementing procedures to preserve the outdoor environment. Broan-NuTone offers a wide selection of products that help meet the requirements of all three major green building programs: ENERGY STAR, U.S. Green Building Council's (USGBC) Leadership in Energy and Environmental Design (LEED) for Homes, and the National Association of Home Builder's (NAHB) Model Green Home Building Guidelines. Broan-NuTone's inspiring heritage provides the foundation for its three award-winning, global brands-Broan, NuTone and BEST. BEST range hoods are the \"Ultimate in Kitchen Ventilation\" featuring state-of-the-art performance and Italian design.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/21P6kFHIrxL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Broan","source_asin":"B000UVUY6Y","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-96590","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B000UVUY6Y","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B000UVUY6Y","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
