window.products.push({"id":96594,"name":"Puritas Pur-02 Replacement MWF Refrigerator Water","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51AewT3qYKL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"The Puritas MWF Replacement Refrigerator Water Filter will leave you with cleaner, clearer, great tasting water and ice. Activated Carbon Technology improves water quality without removing beneficial minerals. Reduces chlorine, odor contaminants and particulate. Also replaces the following filters: GE Part Numbers: MWF, MWFP, HWF, HWFA, MWF3PK, MWFA, MWFAP, MWFDS, MWFINT, MWFP Kenmore Part Numbers: 46-9991, 46-9996, 469991, 469996, 9991, 9996, GWF Aftermarket Part Numbers: CLCH102, RWF1060, SGF-G1, SGF-G9, WF287, WSG-1, OPFG-RF300, GERF-100, RFC0600A, EFF-6013A, EG-1, FMG-1 How To Install The MWF Filter: 1. Remove old filter cartridge by grasping and turning to the left about 1/4 turn. 2. Apply the month sticker (included) to the cartridge as a reminder to replace the filter with 6 months and remove red cap. 3. Align unlabeled side of filter with the indicator line so that it can be inserted into the filter cover. 4. Turn the cartridge 1/4 turn to the right to lock it into place - you will feel a stop and the locked symbol should now be lined up with the indicator line. 5. Flush new cartridge by dispensing water for about 5 minutes. Your refrigerator manufacturer recommends dispensing at least 2 gallons of water to remove trapped air from the water line and discharging any loose charcoal sediment. *Tip: On almost all refrigerators, your reminder light is simply a 6 month timer, it doesn’t measure water volume or tell you if your filter is clogged. Your filter may last for more or less time depending on your local water quality and how much water you use. If your water flow is reduced, or it begins to taste like tap water, you know it is time to change your filter.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51AewT3qYKL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Puritas","source_asin":"B019D4390G","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-96594","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B019D4390G","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B019D4390G","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
