window.products.push({"id":96812,"name":"TraderPlus 125mm Stainless Steel Reusable Coffee Filter Pour Over Stand Cone Coffee Dripper Paperless Coffee Maker with Removable Cup Stand","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71fiLHrmjUL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Specification： Material: 18/8 Grade stainless steel , food safety Capacity: 2 - 4 Cups Dimension: Length: 4.9\". Height: 3.7\" Weight: 7.6oz Features: Fits Securely Most Cups Dishwasher safe or hand washable Reusable micro mesh filter (no paper needed) Easy to Use - Simply place the pour over coffee filter on top of your coffee. - Put two or three tablespoons of medium or coarse ground coffee in the filter. - Pour hot water in the middle and let the water drip through. - Enjoy your coffee. Easy to Clean - Made of stainless steel, rustproof and easy to clean. Just place the coffee dripper in your dishwasher, or simply rinse with warm water immediately after use to prevent coffee grinds and oils from clogging. How to Use: 1. Pour hot water over the dripper to preheat it. 2. Remove the water; fill with grounded coffee, tapping the edges. 3. Set unit over the designated cup or pot. 4. Pour 10% of water across the cones. 5. Add rest of water slowly in a circular motion, keeping the water level consistent. 6. Wait for the water to brew. 7. Remove the filter from the cup or pot. 8. Dump the grounds, scrub the filter, serve from the cup. Warmly Remind: Tips 1: The best grind for a drip coffee would be a medium grind about the texture of sea salt. Use a burr grinder for the best results. Tips 2: Clean the coffee filter by soaking it in a solution of half white vinegar and half water for 30 minutes. Putting it in the top rack of the dishwasher after soaking will also help finish the job. Pcakage Included: 1 X coffee filter","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71fiLHrmjUL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"traderplus","source_asin":"B07FJ6V4NK","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-96812","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07FJ6V4NK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B07FJ6V4NK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
