window.products.push({"id":96840,"name":"LHRIVER Countertop Ice Maker, 26LBS/24H Portable Compact Ice Maker Machine with Self-Cleaning Function, 9 Ice Cubes Ready in 6 Mins, Ice Maker with Ic","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61FE+HAaq9L._SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Efficient Ice Making】Equipped with a high-quality R600a compressor, this tabletop ice maker can produce approximately 9 ice cubes in 6-8 minutes and up to 26 lbs of ice cubes in 24 hours. You can get fresh ice whenever you want with this low-noise countertop ice maker. 【Compact Ice Maker】With dimensions of 8.7*11.6*11.4inch, the compact ice maker will take up little counter space while providing practical functions. Whether for commercial use in coffee shops, bars, restaurants, and KTVs, or for residential use in home kitchens and parties, the portable and powerful ice maker will meet your needs perfectly. 【Self-cleaning Function】The portable ice maker has an advanced self-cleaning feature. Simply press the \"On/Off\" button for five seconds after adding water to use it. Cleaning the machine on a regular basis aids in the removal of harmful substances and the extension of the machine's service life. 【Multiple Smart Functions & Easy Operation】Our ice maker indicators will remind you to take out the ice cubes when the basket is full and will alert you to add water when the ice maker is low on water. Simple and clear control panel is user-friendly enough for you to operate. The transparent viewing window lets you monitor the ice-making process, and the removable ice basket and ice scoop make removing ice a breeze. 【Bullet-shaped Ice Cubes】The round and smooth bullet-shaped ice will not hurt your mouth and will not easily stick together. The hollow design allows ice to float on your drink without affecting its flavor, making it ideal for whisky, beer, and drinks. In addition, it can also be used for frozen food and cold first aid.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61FE+HAaq9L._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"LHRIVER","source_asin":"B0B582LQ54","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-96840","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B582LQ54","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B582LQ54","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
